╭ survey.sav ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ ╭ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮b…│
│ │ arrows, h j k l  move one cell                                          │No│
│ │ mouse            wheel scrolls (Shift: sideways), click selects         │Y…│
│ │ PgUp / PgDn      one screen up / down                                   │No│
│ │ Ctrl+u / Ctrl+d  half a screen up / down                                │Y…│
│ │ Home / End       first / last variable (or field)                       │No│
│ │ g / G            first / last row                                       │Y…│
│ │ 1-9 …            go to row (Enter keeps, Esc goes back)                 │No│
│ │ Tab              next mode: Labels, Codes, Both                         │Y…│
│ │ f                freeze / unfreeze the first variable                   │No│
│ │ Enter            side panel: this respondent, or this variable's values │Y…│
│ │ J / K            scroll the side panel                                  │No│
│ │ i                Variable View and back                                 │Y…│
│ │ d                in Variable View: go to the variable's data            │No│
│ │ y                copy the cell; with values open, the table             │Y…│
│ │ Y                in Variable View: copy the cell                        │No│
│ │ q, Esc           close the panel or view; quit                          │Y…│
│ ╰ any key closes ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯No│
